/cell><cell>-</cell><cell>45, 8</cell></row><row><cell>Ro&#x0364;thlich weiß -</cell><cell>77</cell><cell>-</cell><cell>57, 7</cell><cell>-</cell><cell>49, 6</cell></row></table><lb/>
